{"step_index":42,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:01:46Z","content":"已成功完成第一步優化！\n\n我已將網頁調整為**「目錄快捷導引 + 半隱藏摺疊展開式（Accordion）」**架構。\n\n您可以點擊下方連結預覽最新的網頁：\n\n👉 **[dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html](file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html)**\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ 本次優化的核心功能亮點：\n\n1. **目錄快捷按鈕列 (Quick-Nav Index)**：\n   * 頂部選單保留 6 大段落的專屬按鈕（`01. 產品簡介`、`02. 產品優勢`、`03. 計費優勢`、`04. 帳務優勢`、`05. 安全聲明`、`06. 代理服務`）。\n   * 客戶點擊任意按鈕，**網頁會自動平滑滾動至該區段，並自動展開該區段的完整說明**！\n   * 右上方提供 **「全部展開 📂」** 與 **「全部摺疊 📁」** 快捷按鈕。\n\n2. **半隱藏式頁面 (Collapsible Accordion Sections)**：\n   * 預設狀態下，各段落以簡潔卡片展現標題與亮點標籤（畫面乾淨不洗版）。\n   * 客戶**點擊卡片標題或右手邊的 `▼` 按鈕**，才會動態展開顯示詳細的數據對比、條文內容與原廠官方連結（如 `https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/`）。\n\n---\n\n<agent-embed src=\"file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html\"></agent-embed>\n\n---\n\n接下來，我們可以針對各個段落的**內文樣式、圖表視覺、比較表格或文字呈現**進行逐步的調優！\n\n請問您想先從哪一段（例如：第一段產品對比圖、第二段 PSI 防幻覺流程、或第五段資安 Trust Center 條文）開始細修樣式呢？"}
{"step_index":43,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:22:26Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\n我們來一個一個修正\n　１．產品介紹：　\n　　　－將原廠背書連結移除．改成參考原廠說明連結：https://www.jetbrains.com/business/#lean-in\n　　　－模型選擇：在JetBrains AI Assistant 平台改為＂可調用Claude ／GPT／Gemini 切換\n\n　２．產品優勢：\n　　　－將原廠說明連結中的：\rSmart Chat & Debugging Docs 連結變更為：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/help/ai-assistant/ai-chat.html\n\n　３．計費與模型優勢\n　　　－原廠條款背書中的：AI Service Agreement連結替換成以下連結：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai-service/\n\n　４．帳務管理優勢\n　　　－將原廠文件背書中的：JetBrains Account Console Doc替換為：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/help/jetbrains-console/about-jetbrains-console.html\n　　　－AI CREDITS TERMS替換為以下的連結：\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai-credits/1.0/\n\n　５．第六段在地服務\n　　　－做成兩個部分：\n　　　　－第一部分：訴說代購會產生的問題．點下去後直接跳出使用jetbrains Central Console可以解決的痛點\n　　　　－在卡片的結尾提到在代支代付上時常遇到的問題\n\n以上請修正\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-08-31T23:22:26+08:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
{"step_index":44,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:22:26Z","thinking":"**Analyzing User Requests**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the user's specific requests, item by item. It appears a targeted list of updates across different portal sections has been provided. I'm focusing on the first section and need to address the removal of an existing element there.\n\n\n**Updating Portal Edits**\n\nI've moved on from the first section. Now I am focused on the \"Model Selection Comparison Table.\" I will update text and links in sections two, three, and four. I'm also structuring the sixth section to discuss real-world problems.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"完成 5 項精準內容與連結優化：更換第1-4段的官方原廠正確連結，更新第一段模型選擇描述，並將第六段重構為兩部分（代購痛點與點擊跳出 Central Console 解法，並包含代支代付常見問題結語）。","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-TW\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JetBrains AI Assistant 企業級開發助手 - 迪凱科技 DeKai Technology</title>\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .accordion-content {\n      transition: max-height 0.4s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .accordion-closed {\n      max-height: 0 !important;\n      opacity: 0;\n      padding-top: 0 !important;\n      padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n      margin-top: 0 !important;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .accordion-open {\n      max-height: 3000px !important;\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n  <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-white text-lg shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20\">\n          JB\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-white tracking-tight\">JetBrains AI Assistant</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/30 ml-2 hidden sm:inline-block\">台灣官方代理 迪凱科技</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300 hover:text-white border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-600 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all\">\n          <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\"></path></svg>\n          Trust Center 驗證\n        </a>\n        <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-all shadow-md shadow-indigo-600/30\">\n          申請 30 天企業試用\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Hero Section -->\n  <section class=\"pt-28 pb-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center relative\">\n    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n      高風控企業專用 AI 開發生態\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4\">\n      JetBrains AI Assistant <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-purple-300 to-pink-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">企業級介紹 Portal</span>\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n      點選下方目錄按鈕，即可跳轉至對應單元並展開詳細規格、數據比較與原廠官方驗證說明。\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Section: Table of Contents / Directory Index (快捷導覽按鈕區) -->\n  <section id=\"directory-nav\" class=\"pb-6 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto sticky top-16 z-40 bg-slate-950/90 py-4 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7\"></path></svg>\n        簡報大綱快捷目錄 (點擊自動引導與展開)\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <button onclick=\"expandAllSections()\" class=\"text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 transition-all\">\n          全部展開 📂\n        </button>\n        <button onclick=\"collapseAllSections()\" class=\"text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700 transition-all\">\n          全部摺疊 📁\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Quick Nav Buttons Grid -->\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-2.5\">\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-1')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-400 group-hover:text-indigo-300\">01. 產品簡介</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">市場驗證與比較</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-2')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-400 group-hover:text-purple-300\">02. 產品優勢</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">PSI 靜態分析防幻覺</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-3')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-pink-400 group-hover:text-pink-300\">03. 計費優勢</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">多模型自由切換</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-4')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300\">04. 帳務優勢</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Central Console 配額</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-5')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-400 group-hover:text-amber-300\">05. 安全聲明</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Trust Center 權威驗證</div>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-6')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/50 text-left transition-all\">\n        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-sky-400 group-hover:text-sky-300\">06. 代理服務</div>\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">代購痛點與 Central 解法</div>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Main Content Sections (半隱藏 / 摺疊展開式 Accordions) -->\n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 space-y-6\">\n\n    <!-- SECTION 1: 產品簡介 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-1')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            01\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第一段：產品簡介</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">JetBrains AI Assistant 是什麼？高風控市場驗證與對比</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-1-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-1-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n          JetBrains IDE（IntelliJ IDEA, PyCharm, WebStorm, GoLand, Rider 等）在全台灣與全球各大金融機構、半導體龍頭、證券公司及高風控環境中，早已是不可或缺的標準開發工具。\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Highlights Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs\">\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <div class=\"text-indigo-400 font-black text-lg mb-1\">90%+</div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">金融與證券市場佔有率</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">通抓最嚴苛的企業 IT 資安審查。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <div class=\"text-purple-400 font-black text-lg mb-1\">20+ 年</div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">靜態分析經驗積澱</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">具備全球最頂尖的抽象語法樹 (PSI) 能力。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <div class=\"text-pink-400 font-black text-lg mb-1\">100%</div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">企業合規與安全架構</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">提供 SOC 2 Type II、GDPR 認證與離線模式。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Comparison Table (更新模型選擇描述) -->\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr class=\"bg-slate-900 border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-300\">\n                <th class=\"p-3 font-bold\">比較維度</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 font-bold text-amber-300\">輕量外掛 / 獨立 CLI (如 Claude Code)</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 font-bold text-indigo-300\">JetBrains AI Assistant 平台</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/60 text-slate-300\">\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-white\">專案上下文理解</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">僅文字檔檢索，易遺漏跨檔案繼承</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-indigo-300\">PSI 抽象語法樹 + 全專案符號索引</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-white\">介面與審查</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">純命令行 (CLI)，需手動切換視窗</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-indigo-300\">IDE 原生二元 Diff 審查與一鍵替換</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-semibold text-white\">模型選擇</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">綁定單一模型供應商</td>\n                <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-indigo-300 bg-indigo-950/40\">可調用 Claude / GPT / Gemini 切換</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 更新後的參考原廠說明連結 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-400\">參考原廠說明連結：</span>\n          <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/business/#lean-in\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold hover:underline\">https://www.jetbrains.com/business/#lean-in 🔗</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 2: 產品優勢 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-2')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/20 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            02\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第二段：產品優勢</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">靜態代碼分析 (PSI) + 上下文感知：杜絕 AI 幻覺</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-2-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-2-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs\">\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm mb-2\">傳統 Agent Coding 常見問題</h3>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-slate-300\">\n              <li>• <strong>AI 幻覺 (Hallucination)</strong>：生成不存在的方法或錯誤傳參。</li>\n              <li>• <strong>上下文丟失</strong>：專案變大時丟失深層調用鏈與型別繼承。</li>\n              <li>• <strong>編譯失敗</strong>：產生不符合專案架構規範的寫法。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-indigo-950/30 p-5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-500/30\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-indigo-300 font-bold text-sm mb-2\">JetBrains 獨家靜態分析解法</h3>\n            <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-slate-200\">\n              <li>• <strong>PSI 抽象語法樹預檢</strong>：AI 輸出前先經由 IDE 完成靜態檢查。</li>\n              <li>• <strong>Smart Debugging 診斷</strong>：直連 Debugger 擷取 Stack Trace 解決異常。</li>\n              <li>• <strong>一鍵生成 Git & Test</strong>：自動規範 Commit Message 並補全測試。</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 更換 Smart Chat 官方連結 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-400\">原廠說明連結：</span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/idea/code-inspection.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">Code Inspection Engine 🔗</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/ai-assistant/ai-chat.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold hover:underline\">JetBrains AI Chat Docs 🔗</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 3: 計費與模型優勢 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-3')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/20 border border-pink-500/30 text-pink-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            03\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-pink-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第三段：計費與模型優勢</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">不綁定單一 LLM，同一平台自由切換你愛的 Agent</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-3-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-3-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        <div class=\"bg-indigo-950/30 border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-xl p-5 text-xs\">\n          <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2\">回答客戶：「我們習慣用 Claude 3.5 Sonnet，換成 JetBrains 是不是要放棄？」</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-indigo-200 font-semibold mb-4\">答：完全不需要！JetBrains AI 是開放平台，已原生整合全球最強 LLM 模型。</p>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n              <div class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">Anthropic</div>\n              <div class=\"text-white font-black\">Claude 3.5 Sonnet</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n              <div class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">OpenAI</div>\n              <div class=\"text-white font-black\">GPT-4o</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n              <div class=\"text-sky-400 font-bold\">Google</div>\n              <div class=\"text-white font-black\">Gemini 1.5 Pro</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-800\">\n              <div class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold\">JetBrains</div>\n              <div class=\"text-white font-black\">Mellum (自研)</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 更換 AI Service Agreement 正確連結 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-400\">原廠條款背書：</span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/ai/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">JetBrains Supported LLMs 🔗</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai-service/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold hover:underline\">JetBrains AI Service Agreement 🔗</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 4: 帳務管理優勢 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-4')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            04\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第四段：帳務管理優勢</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">JetBrains Central Console：財務與 IT 的中央管理利器</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-4-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-4-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\">\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-2\">一站式中央帳務與配額儀表板</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">\n              <strong>AI Credits 統一積分機制</strong>：全公司用量、剩餘額度一目瞭然。財務部門再也不用每個月處理大量分散的海外信用卡簽帳與請購比價。\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-2\">精準組織權限控管 (Quota Allocation)</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">\n              IT 管理員可針對團隊或部門設定用量上限，防止少數人員超用導致費用暴增，提供完整審計報表。\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 更換 Console 與 AI Credits 1.0 正確連結 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-400\">原廠文件背書：</span>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/help/jetbrains-console/about-jetbrains-console.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold hover:underline\">About JetBrains Console 🔗</a>\n            <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai-credits/1.0/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-indigo-400 font-semibold hover:underline\">JetBrains AI Credits Terms 1.0 🔗</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 5: 安全可信度聲明 -->\n    <section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-5')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            05\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第五段：安全可信度聲明</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">🛡️ 控制面/數據面分離、零訓練承諾與 Trust Center</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-5-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-5-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs\">\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold mb-1\">1. 控制面與數據面分離</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">JetBrains Central 僅管理授權與點數，原始碼在端點加密傳送，管理伺服器零儲存。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold mb-1\">2. 100% No-Training 承諾</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">JetBrains 及 Anthropic, OpenAI, Google 簽約保證：絕不用於公共模型訓練。</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold mb-1\">3. 30 天銷毀與 SOC 2</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400\">暫存數據最長 30 天強制自動銷毀。通過 SOC 2 Type II 與 GDPR 驗證。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-5 text-center text-xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-white font-bold mb-1\">JetBrains 原廠 Trust Center 權威背書 portal：</h4>\n          <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400 font-bold hover:underline\">\n            https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/ 🔗\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SECTION 6: 在地服務 (重構為兩部分：代購痛點與點擊跳出 Central Console 解法，並附代支代付痛點結語) -->\n    <section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all shadow-xl\">\n      <div onclick=\"toggleSection('sec-6')\" class=\"p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-800/40 flex items-center justify-between transition-colors border-b border-slate-800/60 select-none\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n          <span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/20 border border-sky-500/30 text-sky-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">\n            06\n          </span>\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-sky-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">第六段：在地代理服務 (迪凱科技 DeKai)</span>\n            <h2 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white\">代購/代支代付痛點 vs. JetBrains Central Console 解法</h2>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-medium hidden sm:inline-block\">點擊展開說明</span>\n          <div id=\"sec-6-icon\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold transition-transform duration-300\">\n            ▼\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"sec-6-content\" class=\"accordion-content accordion-closed p-6 space-y-6 bg-slate-950/50\">\n        \n        <!-- PART 1: 訴說代購會產生的問題，點擊直接跳出 Central Console 解法 -->\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-slate-200 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-950 border border-red-800 text-red-400 text-[10px]\">第一部分</span>\n              坊間各大 LLM 散買與代購痛點對比（點擊痛點可直接跳出 Central Console 解法）：\n            </h3>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs\">\n            \n            <!-- Pain Point 1 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-1')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點一：必須向客戶索取帳號密碼</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">代購往往需要客戶提供管理員登入帳密，產生巨大的資安破口與權限風險。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-1\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ JetBrains Central Console 解法：</strong>\n                迪凱科技直接針對貴公司 JetBrains Console 開通授權與 Credits 充值，完全無需透露任何帳號密碼！\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Pain Point 2 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-2')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點二：最低採購數量限制與鎖定</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">原廠規定高額起訂量，團隊超用時遭到全盤鎖定，影響專案進度無所適從。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-2\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ JetBrains Central Console 解法：</strong>\n                零最低數量限制！AI Credits 採彈性充值（10 USD 起算），且 Console 儀表板隨時掌握用量，告別無故鎖定。\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Pain Point 3 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-3')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點三：原廠政策朝令夕改與天天出新 AI</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">市場每天出新 AI，同仁分散要求開請購單；原廠政策缺乏長期遵循標準。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-3\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ JetBrains Central Console 解法：</strong>\n                單一平台包辦 Claude, GPT, Gemini 與 Mellum，不用今天買這家、明天買那家，一套 Console 管理全公司！\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Pain Point 4 -->\n            <div onclick=\"togglePainSolution('sol-4')\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-sky-500/50 p-4 rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition-all\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">✕ 痛點四：海外客服求助無門與帳務繁瑣</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-sky-400 underline\">點擊看解法 ▼</span>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-2\">海外客服一等就是幾週，財務每月處理大量分散外幣信用卡請購。</p>\n              \n              <div id=\"sol-4\" class=\"hidden mt-3 p-3 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-500/30 rounded-lg text-sky-200 animate-fadeIn\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white block mb-1\">✓ 迪凱科技在地服務解法：</strong>\n                迪凱科技提供台灣在地單一窗口服務與合規台幣發票，輕鬆完成核銷！\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PART 2: 卡片結尾：在代支代付上時常遇到的問題 -->\n        <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-400 font-bold text-sm\">\n            <svg class=\"w-4 h-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n            第二部分：在代支代付 (Advance Payment) 上時常遇到的真實窘境與業務心聲\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n            我們作為業務員，過去在嘗試幫客戶辦理各大 LLM 供應商（Github Copilot / ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini）代支代付時，深刻體會到無奈：\n          </p>\n          <ul class=\"text-slate-400 space-y-2 pl-4 list-disc\">\n            <li><strong>帳單與匯率浮動劇烈</strong>：外幣簽帳的手續費、浮動匯率與增購充值通路不明確，讓財務與採購相當頭痛。</li>\n            <li><strong>無權限管理與缺乏企業級控管</strong>：代購產品無法提供企業 Central 儀表板，無法進行人員離職權限回收或用量上限預防。</li>\n            <li><strong>非授權經銷的後續無保障</strong>：散買代購本質上只是「代代支付」，缺乏原廠政策定性與在地技術支援。</li>\n          </ul>\n          <div class=\"pt-2 text-sky-300 font-semibold border-t border-slate-800/60\">\n            👉 **選擇迪凱科技代理的 JetBrains AI 生態**，才能徹底將「代購」轉變為「可控、可信、長期依賴的企業級服務」！\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- CTA Footer Section -->\n  <section class=\"py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4\">\n        「你可以不接受，但是我建議你試試看！在現今這個年代，試試看往往不吃虧。」\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n        迪凱科技誠摯邀請貴團隊開啟 <strong>JetBrains AI 30 天免責企業試用</strong>。\n      </p>\n      <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-xl shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all\">\n        免費申請 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用 ➔\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Enterprise Trial Modal -->\n  <div id=\"trial-modal\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden items-center justify-center p-4\">\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 relative shadow-2xl\">\n      <button onclick=\"closeTrialModal()\" class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg\">✕</button>\n\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-6\">\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3\">\n          JB\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg\">申請 JetBrains AI 30 天企業試用</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1\">請填寫基本資料，迪凱科技專員將於 24 小時內聯繫您服務。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <form onsubmit=\"submitTrialForm(event)\" class=\"space-y-4 text-xs\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">公司名稱 *</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"例如：某某金控 / 科技公司\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">聯絡人姓名 *</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"例如：張經理 / IT 處長\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 font-semibold mb-1\">公司 Email *</label>\n          <input type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"name@company.com.tw\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500\">\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all mt-2\">\n          送出申請 (由迪凱科技專員聯繫)\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Vanilla JavaScript Control Scripts -->\n  <script>\n    // Toggle Accordion Section\n    function toggleSection(secId) {\n      const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n      const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n      const isClosed = content.classList.contains('accordion-closed');\n\n      if (isClosed) {\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-closed');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-open');\n        icon.textContent = '▲';\n        icon.classList.add('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      } else {\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-open');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-closed');\n        icon.textContent = '▼';\n        icon.classList.remove('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Quick Navigation with Auto-Expand\n    function navigateToSection(secId) {\n      const section = document.getElementById(secId);\n      const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n      const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n\n      if (content.classList.contains('accordion-closed')) {\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-closed');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-open');\n        icon.textContent = '▲';\n        icon.classList.add('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      }\n\n      section.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n    }\n\n    // Expand All Sections\n    function expandAllSections() {\n      ['sec-1', 'sec-2', 'sec-3', 'sec-4', 'sec-5', 'sec-6'].forEach(secId => {\n        const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n        const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-closed');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-open');\n        icon.textContent = '▲';\n        icon.classList.add('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Collapse All Sections\n    function collapseAllSections() {\n      ['sec-1', 'sec-2', 'sec-3', 'sec-4', 'sec-5', 'sec-6'].forEach(secId => {\n        const content = document.getElementById(`${secId}-content`);\n        const icon = document.getElementById(`${secId}-icon`);\n        content.classList.remove('accordion-open');\n        content.classList.add('accordion-closed');\n        icon.textContent = '▼';\n        icon.classList.remove('bg-indigo-600', 'text-white');\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Section 6 Interactive Pain Point -> Solution Toggle\n    function togglePainSolution(solId) {\n      const sol = document.getElementById(solId);\n      if (sol.classList.contains('hidden')) {\n        sol.classList.remove('hidden');\n      } else {\n        sol.classList.add('hidden');\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Modal Control\n    function openTrialModal() {\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.remove('hidden');\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.add('flex');\n    }\n\n    function closeTrialModal() {\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.remove('flex');\n      document.getElementById('trial-modal').classList.add('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function submitTrialForm(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      alert('感謝您的申請！迪凱科技專員已收到您的資訊，將於 24 小時內專人與您聯繫安排 30 天 Enterprise 企業試用環境！');\n      closeTrialModal();\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"完成 5 項精準內容與連結優化：更換第1-4段的官方原廠正確連結，更新第一段模型選擇描述，並將第六段重構為兩部分（代購痛點與點擊跳出 Central Console 解法，並包含代支代付常見問題結語）。","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\User\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html","toolAction":"Updating portal HTML with precise user edits","toolSummary":"Update portal HTML with exact link and section edits"}}]}
